Right.

1156
01:19:48,760 --> 01:19:49,640
They're the rivals, right?

1157
01:19:50,160 --> 01:19:57,860
But he, but he's reminding us that we're not just called to love our neighbors who look like us or pray like us or vote like us.

1158
01:19:58,340 --> 01:20:02,020
We're called to actively love those who are the most different from us.

1159
01:20:02,020 --> 01:20:03,520
Maybe those we hate the most.

1160
01:20:04,440 --> 01:20:07,680
And that 2000 years later is still a, a radical teaching.

1161
01:20:08,500 --> 01:20:13,660
And so I have tried imperfectly because we're all imperfect Christians.

1162
01:20:14,080 --> 01:20:19,960
I have tried to follow those two commandments to love God and to love my neighbor as myself.

1163
01:20:20,780 --> 01:20:22,840
It's why I decided to become a public school teacher.

1164
01:20:23,020 --> 01:20:24,020
It's why I ran for office.

1165
01:20:24,020 --> 01:20:28,920
And the work that I do in legislature, I think of as, again, as a form of ministry.

1166
