Um, he was reported the FBI by his own staff.

1196
01:22:12,060 --> 01:22:13,860
He was impeached by his own party.

1197
01:22:14,120 --> 01:22:21,320
And of course, you know, um, his relationships with his own family have now become, um, well known and, and infamous.

1198
