And so if I was to sit down with Ken Paxton, which I would love to do, you'd grab the keys, I would grab the keys and I would, I would urge him to get his own house in order before he tries to tell all of us how to, what to do with our own houses.

1199
01:22:35,940 --> 01:22:42,240
